msgctxt "DrywallTileSkins.STRINGS.DRYWALL_TILE_SKINS.SETTINGS_HINT"
msgid "Choose which tile types to load as Drywall wallpapers. Restart the game to apply."
msgstr "勾选要加载的砖块类型。取消后对应贴图不会生成墙纸。需重启游戏生效。"

